{"unit_id":"snnh__dsh-role-config#card-zh","repo":"snnh/dsh-role-config","commit":"afa3ff9a9d6bbdad6b961db06704169cec73974f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Role Config 是面向 Web 客户端的 DSH 角色路由插件。它在插件设置页管理模型池、角色预设、路由条件与函数绑定，并可注册角色委派和角色列表工具。路由可按提示词、输入模态、上下文窗口或能力标签选择模型；角色链在子代理请求失败后按优先级回退，也可启用 AI 路由。适合需要为不同委派任务配置模型并维护备用模型的 DSH 操作者。安装后需在配置中启用相应工具开关并填写模型路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:90-110","src/tools/delegate.ts:1-20","src/routing.ts:1-10","src/client/index.ts:25-50"]}
{"unit_id":"snnh__dsh-role-config#card-en","repo":"snnh/dsh-role-config","commit":"afa3ff9a9d6bbdad6b961db06704169cec73974f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Role Config routes delegated agents by role in the web client. Its settings page edits model pools, role presets, rules, and bindings. Rules select models by prompt, modality, context window, or capability. Failed requests can fall back through a role’s model chain, with optional AI routing.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:90-110","src/tools/delegate.ts:1-20","src/routing.ts:37-55","src/client/index.ts:25-50"]}
